WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:05.440
<b>Lake Kussharo</b>

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:15.530
Pekanpe?

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.240
You found a lot.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:19.870
I grabbed them as we passed 
through Lake Touro.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.320
When?

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.860
"Pekanpe" means "things which 
float on the lake surface."

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.600
They're Japanese water chestnuts.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.610
We use them as a nonperishable 
food in winter.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.470
These things are so thorny.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:36.340
Ancient ninjas used to dry them 
and use them as caltrops, right?

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.720
Ninja?

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.560
<b>Huci's 13th Younger Sister's Son</b>

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:47.560
Kotan-kor Kamuy is noisy lately.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:49.980
A type of owl.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.570
It's a kamuy that protects the village.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:55.780
It yells at the demons that come from the 
top of the mountains in a loud voice.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.440
We can't just rely on the 
kamuy for everything.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:03.040
If they come, the village men 
will risk their lives to fight.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.660
"They"?

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.710
Bandits that have come to live in this area.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.820
They travel through the 
darkness without even torches,

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.670
coming through the forest to attack.

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:17.590
None of them can see. They're blind bandits.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.640
Someone saw them during an attack.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:25.140
Their leader's body has strange tattoos.

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:31.000
An escaped prisoner from Abashiri?

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:35.650
One of the ones doing hard labor on Mt. Iwo.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.990
His name is Toni Anji.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.060
<b>Golden Kamuy</b>

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:17.420
<b>Lake Kussharo</b>

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:17.420
<b>Mt. Iwo</b>

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:17.420
<b>Lake Mashuu</b>

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:17.420
It was said that nobody sent 
to Mt. Iwo ever came back.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:17.420
<b>Abashiri</b>

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:22.870
Iwo means "sulfur." It's a critical resource 
used in gunpowder and other things.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:29.930
But the sulfuric acid gas it puts out goes in 
through eyes of the people who dig it up.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:34.840
It took just six months for them 
to shut down the operation,

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:38.780
and in that time forty-two died and 
who knows how many went blind.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.490
But I heard a rumor that 
it was secretly restarted,

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:46.080
and Warden Inudou is lending 
out prisoners to it.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:51.280
The ones who fled before they 
were killed are Toni's bandits.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:54.960
During the last new moon the 
village next to ours was attacked.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:57.070
They're careful.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.290
They attack entire villages in large groups,

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:02.090
and always on the new moon, 
when there's no light.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:07.320
It'd be faster to find their 
hideout than wait for the new moon.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:11.050
There's a hot springs inn 
run by a Japanese near here.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.840
You may learn something there.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:13.480
Hot springs?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.670
That sounds great! I'd love to take a bath.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.800
Asirpa-san, is something wrong?

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:30.310
No. I just heard sounds from the 
forest I'd never heard before.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:37.940
Maybe I imagined them.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:46.660
<b>Episode Twenty-One:
The Sound of
an Ambush</b>

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:46.490
I've touched the bodies 
of many different people.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:50.180
But I've never seen such soft muscle before.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:53.020
My hands are sinking in it.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:57.490
Like a big cat... no, a tiger.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.400
What a wonderful gift heaven has given you.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:05.380
And these deep wounds all over your body...

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:08.070
How did you even survive?

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.320
Did you know this, masseuse?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:15.290
When the Ainu have a funeral, they damage 
the individual's kimono and possessions.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:19.690
That takes out their souls, so their 
owner can use them in the next world.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:25.090
If you want to take out my soul, 
you'd need a bigger wound than any of these.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.640
Their souls leave because they've 
finished their job in this world.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:37.350
The reason why your wounds don't kill you is 
that you haven't finished your job here yet.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:47.150
The masseuse told me there used to 
be more hot springs inns around here.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:51.160
When they shut down all operations 
on Mt. Iwo, a lot of inns shut down.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.160
The buildings are still in the forest.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.000
Perfect places for bandits to hide, huh?

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.580
Want to go hunting at dawn?

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.260
Are you okay on your own?

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:07.540
Thank you,

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:10.800
but I'm better at walking
at night than you are.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.970
Really?

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:13.770
Yes.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:17.810
We can't see with our eyes,
but there are things only we can see.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:24.290
Oh, right, miss. Watch out for 
the sound of clogs in the night.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:25.800
Clogs?

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:30.010
The blind bandits who appear at night...

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:33.200
Everyone says it's the sound of clogs.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.620
But it's not.

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:39.080
I heard it one night.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.290
It is the sound of tongues.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:46.550
They click their tongues 
and use the echoes to see.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:47.890
What does it sound like?

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:50.510
How do they click their tongues?

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:54.660
What's that sound?

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:01.600
<i>That sound... They've been 
following us the whole time!</i>

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.070
Who are you guys?

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.570
There's more over here!

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:14.840
That's Toni Anji!

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:23.040
It's too dark to see! How do we fight?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.150
And with our dicks out, too!

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:27.380
We can see you just fine.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.320
That was Shiraishi's voice, wasn't it?

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.440
Did you get hired by the miners?

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:34.420
We're not here to deal with you!

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.140
Just let us copy your tattoo, 
and we'll give you a share.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:41.370
You're not shooting because you're 
willing to make a deal, right?

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.840
I just don't want to hit the kid.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:47.190
If you don't get him out of the bath,
 I'll start shooting now.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.450
That's Ryu's voice!

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:58.190
It's too noisy to make anything out.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:59.580
Get him out of here!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.370
Let's hide in the forest!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.530
Got him!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:18.330
It'll take more wounds than these to kill me!

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:23.060
A gunshot!

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:27.940
Toni Anji seems to be 
the only one with a gun.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:30.310
To stop them from shooting each other?

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:32.640
They approached us from 
the direction of the inn

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:34.950
to keep us from running toward the light.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:38.090
They're used to fighting in the darkness.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:42.250
Ogata was the only one careful enough 
to hide his gun near the hot springs.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:45.050
He's going to complain to us later.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:55.130
Sugimoto...

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.260
Put out the light.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.620
Keep away from the light! 
One of them has a gun!

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.090
<i>I can't see a thing.</i>

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:22.470
<i>And I've only got four bullets left.
I can't waste them.</i>

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:34.180
Asirpa-san, it's me.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.660
Is this blood? Yours?

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.170
Are you hurt?

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:43.550
I'm fine.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:47.350
If it weren't dark,
they'd be no match for me, but...

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.980
If we survive until dawn,

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.660
we start our counterattack.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:56.110
I smell blood.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.890
<b>Golden Kamuy</b>

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.550
Are you really going?

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.760
I'll miss you.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.070
Goodbye, Wilk.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:34.150
Inkarmat...

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.210
This is from my mother.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:39.530
Girls grow up and change so quickly.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.530
You'll become much more beautiful.

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:46.720
If you wear this, then when we 
meet again, I'll recognize you.

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.470
Isn't it important to you?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.760
So are you, my friend.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:52.850
Thank you.

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:58.040
But I'll never see your face again.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:02.180
<i>That's what my fortune-telling 
says my fate is.</i>

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:04.810
Inkarmat!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.730
Tanigaki Nispa!

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.580
Where's Cikapasi?

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:16.000
I told him to find a place 
to hide and stay put.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:28.200
They're coming.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.960
I have an idea. Follow me.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.460
Inkarmat, let's go.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.400
I found this place this afternoon.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.880
If we cross the lake and 
take the long route back,

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.920
we should be able to get back to 
the inn without them finding us.

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:46.630
Get on!

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.670
What's wrong, Inkarmat?

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:52.230
I'm sorry. I can't swim.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:56.020
And I have a terrible premonition.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:01.810
I've handled boats like this since I 
was a kid. I've gone fishing at night.

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:03.410
I know how to use them!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:09.460
If I wanted you gone, I would've 
left you here to die.

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:11.000
Now get on!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:26.260
More to the left. Throw it again.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.500
They're trying to judge the distance!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.940
Tanigaki Nispa!

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:18.090
<i>I see. You're sending me to 
the next world, aren't you?</i>

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:21.810
<i>This is my fate.</i>

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:26.440
<i>To die without ever seeing him again.</i>

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:30.760
<i>The fortunes spoke true.</i>

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:21.590
Tanigaki Nispa, you were shot!

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:24.590
It's fine. It passed through my butt.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:29.210
Hey, are you laughing?

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:32.720
No, I just had the strangest dream.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:34.600
I was remembering it and laughing.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:44.660
<i>Fate can be changed.</i>

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:50.990
Sorry to interrupt your fun,
 but we should go.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:57.750
No!

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:04.000
Dawn's coming.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.800
Hurry, we're getting out of here!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.510
We'll be totally exposed!

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:12.520
Ryu?

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:23.730
The tables have turned.

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:25.160
Sugimoto!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:30.920
Ogata...

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:36.490
Toni Anji and his men went
inside. That's their hideout.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:39.560
If we go back to get our guns, they'll escape.

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:42.440
Let's head inside and finish this now.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.210
Asirpa-san, stay outside.

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:52.890
It's dark.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.030
I'm going in and opening the windows.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:00.330
What is this?

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.440
They've nailed the windows shut.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.370
Sugimoto!

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:12.700
Run!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:26.670
Sugimoto!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.200
Asirpa-san?

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:29.960
How did you get in?

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:31.440
Where's Ogata?

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:32.170
We split up.

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:34.180
It's not safe to move.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.240
What do we do?

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.700
<i>Where is it coming from?</i>

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:42.180
<i>I can't see anything.</i>

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.190
<i>This is their home.</i>

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.140
<i>They can see us perfectly.</i>

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:55.970
Those are pekanpe.

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:19.380
You miners and Warden Inudou must suffer!

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:23.490
We'll take back everything you gained by 
stealing the prisoner's lives and sight!

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:31.400
Take this, you goddamn bastard!

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.270
Where are you, Sugimoto?

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:33.990
Are you okay?

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.270
Don't move, Asirpa-san!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:39.870
You attacked innocent Ainu villages.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:43.110
Justice isn't on your side, you thieves!

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:44.850
That's right.

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:49.500
We're starving and blind. 
It's the only way to survive.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:53.320
We didn't kill anybody who was innocent.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:57.110
Eventually you will.

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:59.210
You can tell?

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.170
Even I can see it...

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:06.770
You can't go back to who you were!

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:22.120
It's been a long time, Toni Anji.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:27.160
That voice! What are you doing here?

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:31.540
Fighting Warden Inudou.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:39.160
We meet again, miss.

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:41.720
Dick-sensei!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:44.560
How'd you find us?

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.310
The dog outside helped us.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:52.690
We had information that Toni Anji
 was lurking in this area.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:58.160
Sugimoto, can you leave 
Toni to us to deal with?

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:01.200
If you'll let me copy his tattoos.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:05.250
But Asirpa-san's relatives live around here.

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:09.330
I'd feel safer if you killed 
him and skinned him.

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:12.800
You live in the dark, hiding,

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:16.040
then coming out at night to harm others.

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:21.840
If you keep this up, your life will 
never escape from the darkness.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:26.470
Damn, but you're right.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.350
<b>Abashiri</b>

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.350
<b>Mt. Iwo</b>

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.350
<b>Kushiro</b>

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.350
<b>Nemuro</b>

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.360
Warden Inudou was lending out the 
prisoners to work at Mt. Iwo,

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:37.210
and using that money to buy weapons.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:39.240
He even had a Maxim gun.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:43.720
It's likely that he's hiding 
other powerful weapons again.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:51.620
And they found you before you could discover 
where those weapons were being held.

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:55.880
Is that correct, Private Usami?

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:58.880
Tsukishima, make him sit.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:08.880
Do you understand how difficult it was 
to get you hired as a guard there?

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.640
<i>You're so close!</i>

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:17.400
I'm going to draw a little stick 
figure on this mole and make it run!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.900
It's running!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:23.400
I'll make the other mole run, too!

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.280
<i>My head is going to boil over!</i>

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:32.040
The two moles are running 
as hard as they can.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:36.850
But they'll never get closer.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:38.490
The poor things.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.300
<b>Abashiri</b>

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.300
<b>Kitami</b>

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.300
<b>Mt. Iwo</b>

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.300
<b>Kushiro</b>

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.300
<b>Nemuro</b>

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:45.600
Inkarmat and Kiroranke...

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:49.590
I wish I could just write it all 
off as a trap of Lt. Tsurumi's.

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:56.310
I had suspicions of my own and 
called an old friend to this city.

00:20:56.310 --> 00:21:00.820
<b>Hirose Photography Studio</b>

00:20:56.310 --> 00:21:00.820
I'll take photos of both of them 
and have someone look into it.

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.820
Why are we taking photos all of a sudden?

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:07.990
I wanted to send a photo
of Asirpa-san to Huci.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:11.370
We should all take one while we're here.

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:20.920
Hijikata-san, I wanted to give you what 
I've been keeping safe for so long.

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:29.890
<i>Sugimoto's his name?</i>

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:34.140
I felt something like nostalgia 
in the middle of the battle.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:42.050
He was just like a young Hijikata-san, 
when I first met him in Abashiri.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:47.370
<i>As fierce as a demon, but somehow kind.</i>

00:23:20.100 --> 00:23:23.770
Um, am I really taking my clothes off?

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:25.480
Everybody else did.

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:30.170
Looking good! Spread your legs a little more!

